            "review_title": "Review at Bun Cha ho Guom",
            "review_text": "Mike D\nHua Hin, Thailand671 contributions\n0\nGreat food at a great price!\nOct 2025 • Couples\nThis is mostly a local place but I advise you to give it a try. Very good food at an extremely good price.\n\nI ordered the Bún Chả Hồ Gươm (stir fried beef noodles) and a Lime Drink. The beef noodles were delicious and the lime drink was refreshing.\n\nThe restaurant, floors, and tables all looked clean.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 13, 2025",
