            "review_title": "Review at Bun Cha ho Guom",
            "review_text": "Brian L\n151 contributions\n0\nGood Grilled Pork\nMar 2019 • Solo\nBack to HCMC for work this time. \nThe Grilled pork is Good .\nThere are few pieces of pork slides and two small pork cake in the bowl with soup/source prepared in the pot Shown.\nTaste is Good but portion is too small for me so I order additional bowl of pork.\nThe fried shrimp roll is definitely a plus. They automatically give me half the order.\nPlease don't expect Any service for foreigners as they speak only Vietnamese. \nJust Order the first One and the second one or show them the photo.\nBTW, You can wrap the pork & Bun(vermicelli) with lettuce provided and filled It with the Mint leaves/basil , or Just put everything in the empty bowl .\nRead more\nWritten March 21, 2019",
