            "review_text": "Jussieu1986\nLos Angeles, California20 contributions\n0\ngood nem cua\nDec 2017 • Couples\nBig place, many tables space out (no sardines like other places). Trash on the floor while a couple of waiters standing there doing nothing.\nService is ok, asking nicely what do you want to order. Food quick on the table and hot. Good nem cua be, true Ha Noi style. Good fish sauce. \nMenu is huge on the wall with prices definitely making it easier for non-Vietnamese speaking so that's a thumb up for the restaurant. \nDon't mind to come back if we have a chance.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten January 24, 2018",
